      ],
      "height_m": 1.8,
      "weight_kg": 85,
      "appearance": "Massive, primarily quadrupedal giant-salamander Pokémon with a broad powerful head, heavily muscled body and limbs, deep-teal skin, a lighter underside, golden eyes and an enormous fan-shaped paddle tail with flowing translucent fins.",
      "personality": "Calm, patient, territorial, formidable",
      "pokedex_entry": "Riptorrent rules the deepest stretches of rivers, where its enormous body remains nearly motionless beneath the current. Its powerful tail can generate torrents strong enough to sweep away large obstacles and reshape sections of the riverbed. Despite its tremendous strength, Riptorrent is a patient ambush predator that rarely pursues prey over long distances. When its territory is threatened, it unleashes a violent surge of water before disappearing into the depths.",
